# the infra instance folder of the demonstration doc page (doc_page_impl_service.md):
# where the service runtime kernel provisions the infra instances the example
# requires (logging for the kernel, sqlite for the todo-list instance), and
# where an infra instance is created from the Services tab. a provisioned
# instance is state, not part of the example: everything here is ignored, so
# a fresh checkout provisions its own. only this file is tracked, so the
# folder exists. to add an infra instance to the example on purpose, list
# its folder here (the way service-app/.gitignore does).
*
!/.gitignore
